<title>FRANCE: Havas holds 99.47 pct of CEP after buy-out.</title>
<headline>Havas holds 99.47 pct of CEP after buy-out.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>French media and advertising group Havas said on Wednesday it holds 99.47 percent of the shares and 95.97 percent of equity warrants in CEP Communication following its public tender.</p>
<p>Havas holds 5,667,706 shares and 2,801,117 warrants, Havas said in a statement. It will today file a compulsory buy out offer and delist the shares, as planned when the tender was announced on January 16.</p>
<p>The tender, at 470 francs per share, was worth a total 2.7 billion francs, Havas said at the time.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452 pnt/cla</p>
